    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 53,
        "text": "Hi, Tom. You look busy. What are you working on?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "54e130c36873f2a57b85a1370ab762df01653ceadc6fac82e73d4fd967865ad8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 59,
        "sourceEnd": 211,
        "text": "Oh, hi Mia. It's the library garden project. You know, the small garden behind the town library? I'm trying to plan it, but I'm not sure where to start.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "de610201f31221bf16b0c14da08be8aa166b0ae260b2164b30fbf897f01f4df1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 217,
        "sourceEnd": 269,
        "text": "Right, I heard about that. So, what's the main goal?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "08af4882c56a2c8bf9fd998f4d31f8220c3acb8fe6715b89c9f1ef2e895a6a41",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 275,
        "sourceEnd": 479,
        "text": "Well, the idea is to turn that unused space into a community garden where people can grow vegetables and flowers. But the library building is old, and the soil might be contaminated. That's a big concern.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "382ce697104d39888a169c6d18102bdcf98e9392fa4590da0e515576a729c7c5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 485,
        "sourceEnd": 549,
        "text": "Contaminated? That sounds serious. Have you had the soil tested?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c94ce8c1d6b901c72c1649cd4f9cba6d74b21003663da85e512a5dec4a7f9069",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 555,
        "sourceEnd": 689,
        "text": "Not yet. That's actually why I'm here. I need to find a lab that can do the testing. But it's expensive, and we have a limited budget.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "eb679b2a52cff95176b8db92d6d9d1af21876606d0b793b432f90a0cc372bfc6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 695,
        "sourceEnd": 791,
        "text": "I see. Maybe you could apply for a grant? There are environmental grants for community projects.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7e74bed2cb4fa95809e9139297c6555723ca38032c37eb260c1294440c42748d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 797,
        "sourceEnd": 929,
        "text": "That's a good idea. I'll look into it. But even if we get the money, we still need volunteers to help with the digging and planting.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "eaf72fe835af2c2707eb757a134252f3eb477d07329313bdb87e6d23fa5659da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 935,
        "sourceEnd": 1023,
        "text": "I can help with that. I'm sure other people would too. Have you asked the library staff?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4c30c6f87e498682b88dd3af58d5e1c864f97c823029bc6cc48303a32da8d985",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1029,
        "sourceEnd": 1199,
        "text": "Yes, I spoke to the head librarian yesterday. She's supportive, but she said we need to be careful about the roots of the old oak tree near the fence. We can't damage it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "9ac1f338cb1413b7c110ea1f1e20445cd64e86993ae7405e06b6f5821b3bd4d4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1205,
        "sourceEnd": 1294,
        "text": "Of course. That tree is probably older than the library itself. So, what's the next step?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6a2ea6d6177caac467dd8c0b23a841283cf7a18288b26c3b5e8b28376ce25863",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1300,
        "sourceEnd": 1479,
        "text": "First, I need to get the soil tested. If it's safe, we can start planning the beds. If not, we might need to use raised beds with clean soil. That would be more expensive, though.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6043da62d02efc0f064760b68b170e9f10ea4b2c371e93e1c725140db2cb9d0e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1485,
        "sourceEnd": 1525,
        "text": "Hopefully it's fine. When will you know?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "f3ed78f165e4653d5bf1be5d3622c09ff132264ce5ab18d55997124966d9c0ae",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1531,
        "sourceEnd": 1621,
        "text": "The lab said it would take about two weeks. So, by next Friday, I should have the results.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "0c121394544c477c27b8841ff5a587bf062c0b7af3f3a75082a0ad041e469b5a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1627,
        "sourceEnd": 1717,
        "text": "Great. Let me know if you need help with the grant application. I've written a few before.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "13fd96a24093bf6ac61266745bfa0806405ba4924661d5e80bb1cbf0260f3438",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1723,
        "sourceEnd": 1794,
        "text": "Thanks, Mia. I appreciate that. I'll send you the draft once I have it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e479f0a0d03d28867e3fbcb7c85aee8136661f22cd4a2bbe1482b5e409ed718c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1800,
        "sourceEnd": 1823,
        "text": "Sounds good. Good luck!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6c7cc5710bd937ccd51a77e21f417c8312743ca0659dd76abe3adeb60ce4b76c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
